~ start

Mae: Company! Gus, put the kettle on, we've got company.
Gus: Kettle's been broke six years, Mae.
- Ask about Todd. [if story.has_flag("todd_mission_accepted") /]
	Mae: Todd? Sweet kid -- fixed our water reclaimer that once. We figured he just wanted quiet. Folks come out here for quiet.
	Gus: Hadn't heard him on the net in... what, three weeks? ...Didn't think anything of it. Should we have thought something of it?
	=> start
- Just saying hello.
	Mae: Aren't you sweet. Not many wave anymore.
	=> start
- Goodbye.
	=> END
